{"task_id": "HumanEval/12", "solution": "from typing import List, Optional\n\ndef longest(strings: List[str]) -> Optional[str]:\n    \"\"\"Returns the longest string from a list, or None if the list is empty. In case of ties, the earliest occurring string is returned.\"\"\"\n    if not strings:\n        return None\n\n    best_string = strings[0]\n    best_length = len(strings[0])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(strings)):\n        current_string = strings[i]\n        current_length = len(current_string)\n\n        if current_length > best_length:\n            best_string = current_string\n            best_length = current_length\n\n    return best_string"}
