{"task_id": "HumanEval/140", "solution": "def fix_spaces(text):\n    \"\"\"Replaces spaces in a string: single spaces become underscores, and runs of 3+ spaces become a single hyphen.\n    Exactly two consecutive spaces become two underscores.\"\"\"\n    result_parts = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(text)\n\n    while i < n:\n        if text[i] != ' ':\n            result_parts.append(text[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            space_count = 0\n            j = i\n            while j < n and text[j] == ' ':\n                space_count += 1\n                j += 1\n            \n            if space_count == 1:\n                result_parts.append('_')\n            elif space_count == 2:\n                result_parts.append('__')\n            elif space_count >= 3:\n                result_parts.append('-')\n            \n            i = j\n            \n    return \"\".join(result_parts)"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/140", "solution": "def fix_spaces(text):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given a string text, replace all spaces in it with underscores, \n    and if a string has more than 2 consecutive spaces, \n    then replace all consecutive spaces with - \n    \"\"\"\n    out = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(text)\n    while i < n:\n        if text[i] == ' ':\n            j = i\n            while j < n and text[j] == ' ':\n                j += 1\n            run_len = j - i\n            if run_len >= 3:\n                out.append('-')\n            else:\n                out.append('_' * run_len)\n            i = j\n        else:\n            out.append(text[i])\n            i += 1\n    return ''.join(out)"}
